Personalized Education Assistant
A web-based application powered by Streamlit, Groq AI, and Serper API to deliver a tailored learning experience. This tool helps learners by generating personalized learning paths, curating relevant content, creating quizzes, and suggesting project ideas based on user expertise levels and interests.

